+(def ^:private value-notes
+  "How the property-writing operations resolve a value and what they refuse. One copy, shared by
+  every operation that sets properties, so the descriptions can't drift apart."
+  (str "A property with choices (such as Status) takes only one of its own choices that the block's tags allow, by UUID, ident, title (ignoring case) or number; any other value is refused with the valid choices listed."
